      "instance_name": "threatening_baby_scene",
      "label": "Baby with threatening text",
      "description": "A baby with a cheerful, innocent expression is juxtaposed with violent, threatening text. The baby's raised clenched fists and smiling face contrast with the text 'when someone thinks it's okay to fuck with you b/c they think you're all love & light' and 'i will stab u in the neck susan', creating a jarring scene of innocence versus aggression.",
